category: Libs
build-depends: cygport bison flex
sdesc: "Library for creating and verifying Netnews Cancel-Locks (utilities)"
ldesc: "libcanlock is a library for creating and verifying RFC 8315
Netnews Cancel-Locks. It also provides article header parsers and command line
tools."
